    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0019 [paragraph] p1: Each Monthly Update patch available on My Oracle Support is divided into a series of archive (ZIP) f
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0020 [paragraph] p1: The ZIP files provided in the Monthly Update will all have a name of the form p___.zip, where:
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0021 [paragraph] p1: - refers to the MOS patch number for the Monthly Update. It will be an eight-digit number, such as 3
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0022 [paragraph] p2: - refers to the Monthly Update’s release in the form YYM, without a separator, such as “263” for 26.
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0023 [paragraph] p2: - refers to one of the supported platforms:
