    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0154 [heading] p14: _Background_
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0155 [paragraph] p14: To resolve the issue causing an incorrect Promotion Name to appear in the Promotion Upgrade Staging 
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0156 [paragraph] p14: _Steps_
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0157 [heading] p14: _Repository Changes_
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0158 [paragraph] p14: 1. Edit the Workflow Process _ISS Promotion Finish Upgrade Sub Process_ as follows:
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0159 [paragraph] p14: - i. Add a Business Service WF Step _Empty Header BC_ between _Done?_ and _Empty Source BC_ WF Steps
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0160 [paragraph] p14: - ii. For the WF Step _Empty Header BC_ , set the following properties.
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0161 [table_row] p14: Name: EmptyHeader BC | Business Service Name Business Service Method: InMemoryUpgrade Data Service I
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0162 [table_row] p14: Name: For the WF Step _Em_ Input Argument | Business Service Name Business Service Method: _pty Head
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0163 [table_row] p14: Name: BC Name | Business Service Name Business Service Method: Literal ISS Promotion Upgrade Header 
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0164 [table_row] p14: Name: Method Name | Business Service Name Business Service Method: Literal EmptyRecord
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0165 [paragraph] p14: - iii. For the WF Step _Empty Header BC_ , add the following Input Arguments.
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0166 [paragraph] p14: - iv. Modify the existing WF Branch Connector between WF Step _Done?_ and WF Step _Empty Source BC_ 
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0167 [paragraph] p14: - v. Add a WF Branch Connector between WF Step _Empty Header BC_ and WF Step _Empty Source BC_ .
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0168 [paragraph] p14: Instructions for 38779291--Fixed an issue to publish Operation field in Integration component.
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0169 [paragraph] p15: _Background_
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0170 [paragraph] p15: User creation via the _User_ Integration Component of the _Users_ Integration Object fails as the Op
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0171 [heading] p15: _Steps_
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0172 [heading] p15: Repository Changes
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0173 [paragraph] p15: Perform the following changes to convert the _operation_ field from “system” to “data”:
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0174 [paragraph] p15: 1. Select the _Users_ Integration Object.
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0175 [paragraph] p15: 2. Select the child Integration Component _User_ .
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0176 [paragraph] p15: 3. Select the child Integration Component Field _operation_ .
    ContentUnit 26_3_update_unit_0177 [paragraph] p15: 4. Modify the Type attribute to “Data”.
